\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Hail! holy, holy, holy, Lord!
\par Whom One in Three we know;
\par By all Thy heavenly host adored,
\par By all Thy church below.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. One undivided Trinity
\par With triumph we proclaim;
\par Thy universe is full of Thee;
\par And speaks Thy glorious name.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thee, Holy Father, we confess,
\par Thee, Holy Son, adore,
\par Thee, Spirit of truth and holiness,
\par We worship evermore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Three persons equally divine,
\par We magnify and love;
\par And both the choirs ere long shall join,
\par To sing Thy praise above.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. Hail! holy, holy, holy, Lord!
\par Our heavenly song shall be,
\par Supreme, essential One,adored
\par In co-eternal Three.
\par                         Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

